      "value": "@{6161a61a2c0de966b4e43486|full_name}: I've been playing with build 11712 for a few hours and haven't had any cross-eyed conditions.\nI will post it when it occurs again. Thank you very much. \nビルド11712で数時間プレイして、寄り目の状態は発生しませんでした。\nまた発生したら投稿します。ありがとうございました。",
